<title>ISRAEL: Israel's Delek Q1 net 29.8 mln shekels.</title>
<headline>Israel's Delek Q1 net 29.8 mln shekels.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-05-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delek, the Israel Fuel Corp,</p>
<p>reported the following first-quarter results:</p>
<p>			   (in thousands of shekels)</p>
<p>			   Q1 97	Q1 96</p>
<p>Revenue	    990,000    947,000</p>
<p>Gross profit     111,600    109,800</p>
<p>Net Profit	  42,800     29,800</p>
<p>Note: Delek reported a one-time net capital gain of 14.1 million shekels from the sale of holdings of Witco, a petroleum and chemicals company.</p>
<p>($1=3.4 shekels)</p>
<p>- Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
